<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $926,250 Italian Open women's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>Ann Grossman (U.S.) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) 6-4 6-3 15-Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>13-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Naoko Sawamatzu (Japan) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat Anabel Ellwood (Australia 6-4 3-6 6-4  </p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani (Italy) beat Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Florencia Labat (Argentina) beat Olga Barabanschikova (Belarus) 6-1 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic) 4-6 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Paola Suarez (Argentina) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 7-5 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Wang Shi-Ting (Taiwan) 6-4 6-3  </p>
<p>12-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Anne Sidot (France) 6-4 6-3 Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic) beat Mariana Diaz-Oliva (Argentina) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Cristina Torrens Valero (Spain) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France) 2-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>9-Brenda Schultz McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) 6-3 6-4  </p>
<p>Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 6-3 6-0</p>
</text>
